«
 @ Check the arguments before touching any setting: 3 real numbers
 IF DEPTH 3 < THEN 0 ELSE
   1 1 3 FOR jj jj 1 + PICK TypeName → tn
     « 0 { "integer" "neg_integer" "bignum" "neg_bignum" "fraction" "neg_fraction" "big_fraction" "neg_big_fraction" "decimal" "neg_decimal" "hwfloat" "hwdouble" }
       1 12 START DUP HEAD tn == ROT OR SWAP TAIL NEXT DROP » AND
   NEXT
 END
 IF NOT THEN "RTPlan needs t1lo t1hi stay (JD JD days), e.g. 2459030 2459075 500" DoError END
 'Precision' RCL 'HardwareFloatingPoint' RCL → savP savH
 « HFP 15 Precision
@@ ============================================================
@@ RTPlan — conjunction-class Earth⇄Mars round-trip optimiser (heliocentric ΔV)
@@ Optimises the outbound Earth→Mars leg (MinΔVTraj), then the return Mars→Earth
@@ leg departing after a minimum surface stay. Patched-conic, pedagogical.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : t1lo t1hi stay   ( t1lo t1hi stay -- { t1 t2 stay t3 t4 ΔVout ΔVret ΔVtot } )
@@   t1lo t1hi : Earth-departure search window (Julian Day)
@@   stay      : minimum Mars surface stay before the return search (days)
@@ Output : { t1 t2 stay t3 t4 (JD)  ΔVout ΔVret ΔVtot (km/s) }
@@ NOTE: set  1 'AstronTXPrecision' STO  for a fast pedagogical run (slow otherwise).
@@ VALIDATION (simulator, AstronTXPrecision 1, golden-section searches):
@@   2459030 2459075 500 RTPlan ->
@@     { 2459055.670 2459260.585 508.514 2459769.099 2460045.086
@@       6.31705 6.48113 12.79819 }
@@   Conjunction Earth⇄Mars: depart 2020-07-25, arrive Mars 2021-02-15 (the
@@   Perseverance window), return 2022-07-08, home 2023-04-10; 2.71 yr; ΔVtot 12.80 km/s.
@@   Level 6 gives ΔVtot 12.79681: within 1.4 m/s at level 1, where the former
@@   ternary searches gave 12.82309, 26 m/s above.
@@   AstronTXPrecision is 1 when the variable does not exist.
@@ ============================================================
 → t1lo t1hi stay
 «
 @ EXIT inside a solver stops the run with an error: restore the settings,
 @ drop the intermediate values, then pass the error on
 DEPTH → dep « IFERR
    'Ⓛ♁Pf' 'Ⓛ♂Pf' t1lo t1hi 150 250 ⓁMinΔVTraj
    → outb
    «
       outb 1 GET outb 2 GET outb 3 GET
       → dVo t1 tofo
       «
          t1 tofo +
          → t2
          «
             'Ⓛ♂Pf' 'Ⓛ♁Pf' t2 stay + t2 stay + 400 + 200 350 ⓁMinΔVTraj
             → retn
             «
                retn 1 GET retn 2 GET retn 3 GET
                → dVr t3 tofr
                «
                   t1 t2 t3 t2 - t3 t3 tofr + dVo dVr dVo dVr + 8 →List
                »
             »
          »
       »
    »
   THEN
    DEPTH dep - DROPN
    savP Precision  IF savH THEN HFP ELSE SFP END
    ErrorMessage DoError
   END
 » »
savP Precision  IF savH THEN HFP ELSE SFP END
 »
»
